[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11223.309, "timestamp": "03:07:03", "text": "我确保它更加独特，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11228.15, "timestamp": "03:07:08", "text": "东西，而且很适合我这种类型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11230.87, "timestamp": "03:07:10", "text": "这位模特真漂亮。那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11233.67, "timestamp": "03:07:13", "text": "优先事项？是的。是的。我的上帝。那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11236.71, "timestamp": "03:07:16", "text": "优先事项？我的天啊。如果这是优先事项，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11240.67, "timestamp": "03:07:20", "text": "然后把它放到优先级框里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11250.469, "timestamp": "03:07:30", "text": "这个东西。没关系。没关系。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11253.349, "timestamp": "03:07:33", "text": "这是第二次迭代，它得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11257.19, "timestamp": "03:07:37", "text": "昨天收到了修复后的更新。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11260.55, "timestamp": "03:07:40", "text": "原本打算分享给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11263.11, "timestamp": "03:07:43", "text": "公众如同剪影版本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11265.95, "timestamp": "03:07:45", "text": "但它，嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11269.19, "timestamp": "03:07:49", "text": "这位艺术家做不到，因为她是个新手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11272.469, "timestamp": "03:07:52", "text": "她把生活重心放在了其他事情上，所以她没有分开。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11273.469, "timestamp": "03:07:53", "text": "事物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11276.469, "timestamp": "03:07:56", "text": "确实非常好"}]